<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_clear_folders">TplAppClearFolders</link></para>

<para>This class provides a method to generate an action string for clearing folders within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. </para>
