    <title>process()</title>
<indexterm><primary>process</primary><secondary>TplAppClearFolders</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>TplAppClearFolders</primary><secondary>process</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput>process ( )<computeroutput>[static]</computeroutput></computeroutput></para>
<para>Generates an action string to clear folders.</para>

<para>This method constructs and returns an action string that triggers the <computeroutput>CLEAR_FOLDERS</computeroutput> action. The action string includes the caption and glyph for the menu item, which are retrieved from the language settings.</para>

<para>@global object $bearsamppLang Provides language support for retrieving language-specific values.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>Returns</title>

<para>string The generated action string for clearing folders. </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
